1000 GOSUB 9505:GOSUB 5500:GOSUB 6100:BM$="When he woke up the next day, David was feeling great, as if he had never\been tired the previous night. Alan and Martin were working on the new\song at their label's studio, while Andrew was out with a friend.":GOSUB 5100
1010 ISET X:BM$="Susanna came by to visit David.":GOSUB 5100
